        "notes": "Round 7 \u2013 Choose  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f)  as your Round 7 power. It applies a powerful AoE slow during your ultimate, perfect for locking down teamfights or preventing enemies from escaping. \n\nEquip  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)  as your final item. It provides passive healing every second and lowers skill cooldowns, allowing you to cycle abilities faster during intense engagements.\n\n\nIf you have additional funds, consider upgrading your build by replacing  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)  with:\n\n-  [Goddess\u2019s Aura](item_a36d46c8-cee0-4c97-b6e4-72bb816c13dc) :- If you\u2019re frequently targeted right after teleporting, this grants extra health when using Swift Step, boosting your survivability.\n\nor\n\n-  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) :- Ideal against consistent pressure from hitscan or beam heroes like Soldier: 76 or  Zarya, this helps mitigate damage right as you teleport.\n\nor\n\n-  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) :- A strong counter against one-shot heroes, offering critical protection during aggressive plays or flank pressure.",
